                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9f3f99e8-571b-3190-87fc-3f27927e3905",
                        "entry_id": "184f1203-af40-30b4-bac1-3fafc8ad096d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "angst en vrees veroorzakend"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c88554f-a9bf-4291-8f89-ce37df6b0594",
                                "sense_id": "9f3f99e8-571b-3190-87fc-3f27927e3905",
                                "text": "Ja, daar heb je wat aan: Billy's boom zal angstwekkend zijn."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5c1dd54-14fb-4435-a614-f857d37a47b8",
                                "sense_id": "9f3f99e8-571b-3190-87fc-3f27927e3905",
                                "text": "Het was angstwekkend, de manier waarop ze de boosaardige persoonlijkheid van de moordenares verwisselde voor die van de eenvoudige huishoudster."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "652c5b96-c6dd-42d9-9906-7773b91c7c21",
                        "source_entry_id": "184f1203-af40-30b4-bac1-3fafc8ad096d",
                        "source_sense_id": "9f3f99e8-571b-3190-87fc-3f27927e3905",
                        "target_lang_word": "horrible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "horrible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69df9712-cb50-3928-bfe3-8cf04eb030f1",
                                        "entry_id": "6740310b-3a6a-3857-b270-9d97231c0f4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thing that causes horror; a terrifying thing, particularly a prospective bad consequence asserted as likely to result from an act."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3468efcc-ce7f-435c-85bd-b6878fdd5a71",
                                                "sense_id": "69df9712-cb50-3928-bfe3-8cf04eb030f1",
                                                "text": "Here's a carcase. I know not all that may be coming, but be it what it will, I'll go to it laughing. Such a waggish leering as lurks in all your horribles!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4123651-91da-4901-8972-e81eb8dafd2f",
                                                "sense_id": "69df9712-cb50-3928-bfe3-8cf04eb030f1",
                                                "text": "A lot of the possible horribles conjured up by the people objecting to this convention ignore the plain language of this treaty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31ae4431-3948-4d0b-b827-c9de983f71fe",
                                                "sense_id": "69df9712-cb50-3928-bfe3-8cf04eb030f1",
                                                "text": "The pot had previously simmered skate wings, cods' heads, whales, pigs' hearts and a long litany of other horribles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "900b3480-6015-48bb-9694-98bcc0a7b25f",
                                                "sense_id": "69df9712-cb50-3928-bfe3-8cf04eb030f1",
                                                "text": "I'm trying to convince him that the criminal behavior that's going on at the White House has to end. And I give him one horrible after the next. I just keep raising them. He sort of swats them away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b6e41b-ddf2-4ca0-8fc2-d06904c41ec5",
                                                "sense_id": "69df9712-cb50-3928-bfe3-8cf04eb030f1",
                                                "text": "Many scholars have demonstrated these horribles and contemplated significant limitations on class actions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af69bc8e-8205-3eef-b47a-374c6369b3cb",
                                        "entry_id": "6740310b-3a6a-3857-b270-9d97231c0f4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person wearing a comic or grotesque costume in a parade of horribles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "horrible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c9d3ef0-d3ce-32f9-9a28-b4ec2a45feca",
                                        "entry_id": "6ee05714-4a64-3793-9b98-602bace5570c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing horror; terrible; shocking."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bedaf32-15b9-430a-be19-a2759e836b48",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9d3ef0-d3ce-32f9-9a28-b4ec2a45feca",
                                                "text": "Such a scandal as the prosecution of a brother for forgery—with a verdict of guilty—is a most truly horrible, deplorable, fatal thing. It takes the respectability out of a family perhaps at a critical moment, when the family is just assuming the robes of respectability: […] it is a black spot which all the soaps ever advertised could never wash off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32e08d8e-af9e-4cde-9c9d-88b722d75154",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9d3ef0-d3ce-32f9-9a28-b4ec2a45feca",
                                                "text": "Strangers fainted dead away at the sight of the Laughing Man's horrible face. Acquaintances shunned him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e4df8a4-9969-4bfa-afd0-1a921e83ba88",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9d3ef0-d3ce-32f9-9a28-b4ec2a45feca",
                                                "text": "Some of us have had plastic surgery on our faces and fingerprints. Right now we have a horrible job; we're waiting for the war to begin and, as quickly, end."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6386f03-02bc-4b52-ac37-b73463a1729a",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9d3ef0-d3ce-32f9-9a28-b4ec2a45feca",
                                                "text": "Her own mother lived the latter years of her life in the horrible suspicion that electricity was dripping invisibly all over the house."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "074d874c-6980-3a8c-879a-625af8282670",
                                        "entry_id": "6ee05714-4a64-3793-9b98-602bace5570c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tremendously bad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b53734e-7d70-4352-8d0a-43598ffde151",
                                                "sense_id": "074d874c-6980-3a8c-879a-625af8282670",
                                                "text": "Having now absorbed all or parts of 750 responses to my complaints about Transformers, I suppose I shouldn't be surprised that most of those writing agree with me that it is a horrible movie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
